en_US:
Welcome to Café Warehouse,
a stylish café in a rural area!{VAR BE01}
Our café has a special on Wednesdays!
Here, have a Soda Pop!{VAR BE01}
Enjoy the taste of our specialty!{VAR BE01}

As far as I'm concerned, it doesn't
matter that the café is in a rural area{VAR BE00}
that nobody knows.

Do you know about the Battle Box?{VAR BE01}
I heard it is a useful function you can
use at the Pokémon Center.

The Striaton City Gym Leaders are a
great triplet combo!{VAR BE01}
The Grass-type Pokémon user, Cilan,
chooses great tea leaves.{VAR BE01}
The Water-type Pokémon user, Cress,
prepares the best water.{VAR BE01}
And the Fire-type Pokémon user, Chili,
pours hot water at the right heat.{VAR BE01}
No wonder their tea is the best!

When you battle with a friend using
wireless communications, you can use{VAR BE00}
items using a Wonder Launcher!

Yes, I know!{VAR BE01}
If you have a Wonder Launcher, energy
will be charged, and you can use{VAR BE00}
various items.
